flowchart TD
  Target[LAB target ID + pinned authority cut]
  Check{Reserved boundary\nor existing-lane eligibility failure?}
  Listed{ADR-0014 exact owner\neditable target active?}
  Dormant[Dormant deferred item\nrecorded reopen trigger absent]
  Escalate[Escalated bundle\nowner / canon action required]
  Candidate[LAB candidate\ncomparison and falsifier]
  Evidence[Positive and negative evidence\nreproducible commands]
  Freeze[Steward rebase/freeze\nbase, blobs, diff, evidence, rollback]
  Review{Independent review\nof exact frozen cut passes?}
  L3[Canon L3 working state\nLAB candidate history]
  L2[Canon L2 working state\nreviewed and reversible]
  Falsified[Falsified or superseded\nforward-recorded in LAB]
  Owner[Owner disposition or ADR]
  Recut[Re-read affected canon / SCN / ledger\nand update derived views]

  Target --> Check
  Check -- deferred without trigger --> Dormant
  Check -- reserved or ambiguous --> Escalate
  Check -- eligible --> Candidate --> Evidence --> Listed
  Listed -- no --> Candidate
  Listed -- yes --> Freeze --> Review
  Review -- scope defect --> Escalate
  Review -- candidate remains open --> L3
  Review -- provisional selection --> L2
  L3 --> Candidate
  L2 -- falsifier: freeze reliance --> Falsified --> Freeze
  L2 --> Recut
  L3 --> Recut
  Escalate --> Owner
  Owner -- deferred --> Dormant
  Owner -- scoped authorization --> Target
  Owner -- L0/L1 or lifecycle record --> Recut

  classDef canon fill:#dcefe2,stroke:#22543d,color:#102a22
  classDef lab fill:#edf2f7,stroke:#4a5568,color:#1a202c
  classDef stop fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#9c6b00,color:#3b2f00
  class Target,L3,L2,Owner canon
  class Candidate,Evidence,Falsified,Recut lab
  class Check,Listed,Dormant,Escalate,Review stop
